This setting of the 105CA is centered on 28.400 MHz
for Low Phone operation.  It has a 2:1 VSWR band-
width of 1100 KHz centered on 28.400.  Maximum gain
is 8.22 dBd and maximum F/B is 27 dB.

Beta rod length= 17 inches (measured from inside
tubing edge to outside edge of clamp).  Pigtail
length= 7 inches.  Balun= Hy-Gain BN-4000 (current
type)

Radiation patterns and VSWR were verified in September
1991.  9-18-91  RC


